    {
      "category": "article",
      "codeAnchor": {
        "exactQuote": "16. ( 1 ) The Central Government may, by notification, restrict the transfer of personal data by a Data Fiduciary for processing to such country or territory outside India as may be so notified.",
        "occurrence": 0,
