        {
          "exactQuote": "( 2 ) The Board shall be a body corporate by the name aforesaid, having perpetual succession and a common seal, with power, subject to the provisions of this Act, to acquire, hold and dispose of property, both movable and immovable, and to contract and shall, by the said name, sue or be sued.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:282"
